    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning two bedroom mid terraced bungalow with a stylish open plan interior and an amazing landscaped garden to the rear.\n\nThis superb property features an attractive brick façade which opens to an eye catching south facing living room with a tiled floor and built in storage. Both bedrooms are positioned to the right of the living room and come with comfy carpet flooring. The light filled open plan kitchen & dining area enjoys access to an internal courtyard and boasts plenty of counter & cupboard space. The stylish fully tiled bathroom comes with high spec sanitary ware and under sink storage. Double doors from the kitchen open to an amazing patio and landscaped garden which is the perfect place to relax and entertain. This fantastic property also benefits from free on street parking to the front.\n\nLiffey Street South is ideally located in The Ranch which is situated just outside the village of Inchicore and also close to Chapelizod, Ballyfermot and Kilmainham. There are plenty of amenities close by including shops, bars, cafes and restaurants. There also some excellent outdoor leisure facilities in the area such as The Memorial Gardens, The Phoenix Park and Markievicz Park. Liffey Gaels GAA Club, Donore Harriers Running Club, Commercials Rowing Club and Longmeadows Pitch & Putt Club are all nearby. The city centre is easily accessible by Dublin Bus.\n\nFeatures:\nYear of construction 1910\nBrick façade\nLarge back garden\nOpen plan\nStylish interior\nFully tiled bathroom\nSought after location\nOn street parking\nInternal courtyard\nHigh spec kitchen\n"
